WEBVTT

00:02:28.260 --> 00:02:30.450
What beautiful scenery!

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:31.720
View halloo!

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:35.460
Staying at a hot-springs inn
with Ranma-honey.

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:38.190
Tonight is going to be special!

00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:43.040
What you say!? Me and Ranma
make sweet travel memories!

00:02:43.140 --> 00:02:45.540
Will you two stop?

00:02:45.640 --> 00:02:48.540
Why'd you crash
our family trip, anyway?

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:52.670
Look at them all!

00:02:52.780 --> 00:02:54.880
Which one should I choose?

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:58.650
This one!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:03.360
This is the yukata I like!

00:03:16.240 --> 00:03:18.210
The doll of revenge?

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:24.710
Did you see that cute doll on
display coming into the springs?

00:03:25.220 --> 00:03:27.210
Come to mention it...

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:36.060
It seems this inn has an ancient
legend attached to that doll.

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:45.800
If anyone is rude to it, or gets
it dirty, the doll takes revenge.

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.600
That one scarifying doll.

00:03:48.710 --> 00:03:51.900
I don't want it mad at me.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:56.340
Reality check time.
This is a DOLL here.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:00.110
You have no romantic soul,
Nabiki Tendo.

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:01.810
Nabiki, what if...?

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:05.150
How's a doll going to take revenge?

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:09.390
It's made up. Customers want
mystery; the inn is pandering.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:16.630
Ha ha--! You missed me--!

00:04:17.030 --> 00:04:18.130
You thief!

00:04:18.740 --> 00:04:20.600
That milk...

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:22.400
...IS MINE!

00:04:26.050 --> 00:04:28.000
Cold Spring
For a Nice, Cold Soak

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:33.670
Look at what you did now!

00:04:33.920 --> 00:04:36.440
A panda and a pigtailed girl
are fighting on the men's side!

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:37.420
Can't miss this!

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.790
Anybody got a camera?

00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:44.350
Wait up, old man!

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:47.290
Ranma, you're outclassed!

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:53.170
You drank it! Now eat foot!

00:04:54.540 --> 00:04:56.730
Windmill!

00:05:04.680 --> 00:05:06.880
Aw, man!

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:13.220
Ohmigod! If they catch me,
I'll have to pay for it!

00:05:24.770 --> 00:05:26.960
That's about right.

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:55.660
Shampoo admit,
some baths in Japan are good.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:58.360
I forgot my brush back there.

00:05:58.470 --> 00:05:59.770
See you back at the room, then.

00:05:59.870 --> 00:06:02.130
That's Akane for you.

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:23.690
Now I have to walk by
that scary doll all alone.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.230
Danger!
Do Not Touch

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.410
Cheers!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:52.350
Good beer and good scenery!

00:06:52.460 --> 00:06:54.720
You said it, Saotome!

00:06:55.660 --> 00:06:58.460
Chimes are unusual for autumn,
but this adds a little elegance.

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:03.030
You sure took your time, Akane.

00:07:03.130 --> 00:07:05.800
Yes, what you do so long, Akane?

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:08.930
Everybody's been waiting for you.

00:07:15.950 --> 00:07:18.970
What's wrong, Akane?
You're looking pale.

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:23.980
Where is that disgraceful man?

00:07:24.520 --> 00:07:26.680
Disgraceful man?

00:07:26.790 --> 00:07:29.950
If you mean Ranma, he went
off looking for you, Akane!

00:07:30.890 --> 00:07:33.090
Ranma.

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:36.860
So his name is...

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:39.160
...Ranma.

00:07:41.440 --> 00:07:43.630
Hey, Akane!

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:47.270
Akane!

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.850
W-Where am I? I remember...

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:52.880
That idiot. Where'd she go?

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:53.850
Ranma!

00:07:55.020 --> 00:07:57.210
That hurt!

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:00.180
What?

00:08:00.290 --> 00:08:02.280
W-What's going on?

00:08:02.990 --> 00:08:04.980
That's weird. I thought l...

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.830
T-That's me!

00:08:11.900 --> 00:08:14.300
Ranma! Prepare yourself!

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:17.870
What's the meaning of this, Akane?

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.910
You have skill, you brute!

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:21.840
You're just noticing that NOW?

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:26.240
What's going on!?
What am I doing over there!?

00:08:26.350 --> 00:08:27.870
What you do, Akane?

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:31.850
Stop playing with dolls,
and let's eat!

00:08:32.990 --> 00:08:34.580
"D-Doll"!?

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.150
There we go.

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:38.660
"Doll"?

00:08:38.730 --> 00:08:41.860
I'm a doll!?

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:44.900
Shampoo hungry!

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:45.660
That means...

00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:50.530
That means the "me" over there is...

00:08:54.210 --> 00:08:56.610
Time for bath number two...

00:08:59.320 --> 00:09:02.910
Gotta watch out.
We're two stories up.

00:09:03.020 --> 00:09:04.880
Are you hurt anywhere?

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.580
Here.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.220
Oh yeah, it's not serious.

00:09:11.360 --> 00:09:12.390
Let's use this.

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:15.590
Now what?

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:16.390
Gee.

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.960
Is Akane...

00:09:22.070 --> 00:09:23.870
...always like this?

00:09:23.970 --> 00:09:26.910
She's usually a little vicious.

00:09:34.120 --> 00:09:36.420
I-I can move!

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:45.890
My daily training
comes in handy after all.

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.660
Ready!

00:09:57.510 --> 00:10:00.480
The doll's doing Sumo exercises!

00:10:03.710 --> 00:10:05.180
That's good!

00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:07.810
I can't get under his guard.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:10.680
So I'll have to force his guard down!

00:10:15.060 --> 00:10:17.460
Akane has weird attitude.

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:21.520
A completely different person.
Something's behind this.

00:10:21.630 --> 00:10:24.690
She eat something bad
back at the baths?

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:28.330
When did she start
wearing that ribbon?

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:37.010
Ranma? He took Akane for a walk.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:39.110
What was that!? What you say!?

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:48.950
This is strange.
A-Aren't I there yet!?

00:10:52.200 --> 00:10:55.820
T-The entrance.
I'm going the wrong way.

00:10:55.930 --> 00:10:58.130
I'm such an idiot!

00:11:00.400 --> 00:11:01.340
Ranma!

00:11:03.270 --> 00:11:07.230
Turn around!
Ranma! Ranma!

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:20.080
Don't interfere. Just be a good
little girl until I'm finished.

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:24.860
W-What are you doing!?
Get this off of me!

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:27.600
Akane, what were y'doin' back there?

00:11:30.130 --> 00:11:32.000
You're actin' weird.

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:34.570
You're as nasty as ever, but...

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:36.610
What did he say!?

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:43.610
W-W-What's this for, all of a sudden?

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:49.420
Don't you know?

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:57.380
Can't you figure out
a woman's feelings?

00:11:58.800 --> 00:12:03.030
Wait a second! What are
you doing with my body!?

00:12:12.610 --> 00:12:15.600
Doll Inn

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:34.250
If you wanna take a walk,
let's go someplace less deserted.

00:12:34.760 --> 00:12:38.760
I want to be all alone with you.

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.100
You don't want that?

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:49.800
T-That's not what I meant...

00:12:53.720 --> 00:12:58.310
It's so heavy! She's got
me right where she wants me.

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:01.780
I have to do something!

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:05.730
Y'see, it's not a matter of
what I want. I just...

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:06.820
RETRIBUTION!

00:13:06.900 --> 00:13:08.020
Hold it right there!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:13.760
Sneaking him away like that!
No fair, Akane!

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:17.530
I thought you act strange.
So this the reason!

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.570
No, I can explain...

00:13:21.210 --> 00:13:23.180
I talking to Akane!

00:13:23.280 --> 00:13:25.580
Ranma-honey,
you'd best stay out of this.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.050
What's the deal with you two?

00:13:28.150 --> 00:13:30.090
Ranma-honey is mine!

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:31.080
Prepare to die!

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:36.320
She's so fast!

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:37.520
She not like usual!

00:13:48.300 --> 00:13:50.500
Hey! You cheated!

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:57.870
Where did Ukyo and Shampoo go?

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:01.580
They figured out the obvious,
and went back to the room.

00:14:03.220 --> 00:14:05.210
I-I see.

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:08.520
Well, shall we go a little
deeper into the forest?

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:13.190
Somebody... Help me!

00:14:15.330 --> 00:14:19.130
Ushio, there's a doll out here.

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:21.100
You're right, Tonko.

00:14:23.370 --> 00:14:24.270
Poor thing.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:25.840
All better.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:28.910
I have to warn Ranma!

00:14:29.910 --> 00:14:32.750
Thank you for your kindness.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:39.350
We were thanked by a DOLL!!

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:52.400
Dear Akane, it is fully autumn
here in tropical Okinawa.

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:57.640
Once I have a little money,
I'll head directly back to you.

00:14:58.440 --> 00:15:00.640
You can expect a
souvenir on that day.

00:15:01.440 --> 00:15:05.440
To my beloved Akane Tendo,
from Ryoga Hibiki.

00:15:08.150 --> 00:15:15.820
Akane, despite the miles between us,
maybe we see the same stars.

00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:19.960
This way, Ranma.

00:15:26.870 --> 00:15:30.270
Handwash Miniature Waterfall
No playing in the water.
No drinking the water.

00:15:31.510 --> 00:15:33.000
Ranma?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:35.240
Close your eyes.

00:15:37.910 --> 00:15:39.250
What's this about?

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:44.750
Are you going to force me to say it?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:06.070
Y'see... I'm still in trainin' and...

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.570
Gotcha!

00:16:12.480 --> 00:16:13.540
Is he on to me?

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:18.050
You can trick the rest of the world...

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:19.710
...BUT YOU AIN'T FOOLIN' ME!

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:21.390
Owchie!

00:16:21.490 --> 00:16:23.430
What was that for!?

00:16:23.530 --> 00:16:27.960
Old man, spyin' on me...

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:30.930
You'll never get anywhere
worrying over trifles!

00:16:31.030 --> 00:16:33.260
Ranma!

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:35.460
A real man eats when the table is set!

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.100
Let's go someplace quieter.

00:16:38.210 --> 00:16:39.730
Akane, brava!

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.740
Parental consent!?

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:52.510
Go someplace quieter!?

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:55.750
It's gone that far?

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:58.450
We're rooting for you, Akane!

00:16:58.560 --> 00:16:59.260
Look.

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:01.890
Isn't that Ryoga?

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:05.160
You're right. What brings him here?

00:17:05.970 --> 00:17:06.760
He's down.

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:12.460
Alone at last.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:30.050
Let's just be together a while.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:51.550
P-chan!

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:57.440
P-chan! It's me! Akane!

00:18:04.790 --> 00:18:06.280
This time for sure!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:19.800
See? That's me! I'm Akane! Got it?

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.350
It's me! Akane!

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:37.320
A...

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:57.910
Ranma!

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:12.550
Come on.

00:19:12.660 --> 00:19:13.530
O-Okay.

00:19:15.670 --> 00:19:18.260
Please, P-chan! Hurry!

00:19:22.640 --> 00:19:25.570
Hold on, Ranma! I'm coming!

00:19:25.680 --> 00:19:28.440
Don't you dare do anything!

00:19:37.250 --> 00:19:41.020
Somethin' is wrong here.
You're not the Akane I know.

00:19:41.120 --> 00:19:45.580
That's right! You've finally
noticed! She's an impostor!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.360
You're much cuter, now.

00:19:49.700 --> 00:19:53.190
Kinda sexy... Nice...

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:56.930
What was that!?

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.380
Get 'em, P-chan!

00:20:09.720 --> 00:20:10.690
'S cold!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:14.590
Man, what the heck was that?

00:20:14.690 --> 00:20:16.680
Who are you!?

00:20:17.630 --> 00:20:19.820
A-Akane?

00:20:20.730 --> 00:20:22.660
Where is that cursed Ranma?

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:27.430
Akane, what's your...

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:31.370
That's right, Ranma!
Now you know!

00:20:31.470 --> 00:20:32.940
She's an impostor!

00:20:37.980 --> 00:20:38.950
You!

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:43.410
Uh-oh. I forgot that dolls can't talk!

00:20:43.520 --> 00:20:46.550
Where do you keep appearing from?

00:20:49.190 --> 00:20:52.650
This doll's movin'! What makes it tick?

00:20:57.070 --> 00:20:59.260
This your toy?

00:21:03.110 --> 00:21:04.070
Ranma.

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:09.740
Look.

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:32.830
DON'T LOOK!!

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.040
You're wide open!

00:21:51.550 --> 00:21:52.540
How dare you!

00:21:52.620 --> 00:21:54.110
Get outta my way!

00:21:57.790 --> 00:22:00.260
Akane! What's with you!?

00:22:00.860 --> 00:22:02.890
RETRIBUTION!

00:22:15.880 --> 00:22:18.070
That was scary.

00:22:20.750 --> 00:22:27.420
You're a weird doll.
It's like you tried to help me.

00:22:29.390 --> 00:22:31.950
Look how dirty your face is.

00:22:32.060 --> 00:22:37.190
I don't know if I'll ever be
able to go back to my real body.

00:22:37.830 --> 00:22:41.930
If no one realizes who I am...

00:22:43.010 --> 00:22:45.200
Ranma! Look at me!

00:22:46.040 --> 00:22:48.510
You look just like Akane.

00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:52.910
Kinda cute, in a tomboy fashion.

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:11.270
The... The doll's crying.

00:23:17.940 --> 00:23:19.930
She put us through heck!

00:23:20.040 --> 00:23:23.810
Hurry, Shampoo! If Akane
has already made her move...

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:28.320
Akane!

00:23:30.790 --> 00:23:32.780
Now taste my vengeance!

00:23:36.730 --> 00:23:37.380
Ranma!

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:38.120
Ranma!

00:23:38.190 --> 00:23:39.790
Ranma, that doll is...

00:23:40.600 --> 00:23:42.260
You idiot!

00:23:42.360 --> 00:23:45.490
You could really get hurt like this!

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.560
Who cares! I'm just
borrowing this body, anyway!

00:23:49.670 --> 00:23:50.500
What!?

00:23:51.570 --> 00:23:53.010
Ranma...

00:23:57.910 --> 00:23:59.040
What are you doing?

00:23:59.150 --> 00:24:03.520
I don't get this, but I can't
let you or the doll get hurt!

00:24:14.900 --> 00:24:17.060
Help me! I-I can't breathe...

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:19.030
Akane!

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:19.830
Ranma!

00:24:19.900 --> 00:24:20.560
Ranma!

00:24:29.650 --> 00:24:32.240
Akane, are you okay? Akane!

00:24:36.620 --> 00:24:38.780
You're not hurt, right?

00:24:40.160 --> 00:24:43.750
I-I'm myself again...

00:24:45.930 --> 00:24:48.120
I was so scared!

00:24:50.930 --> 00:24:53.600
Akane's crying.

00:24:54.840 --> 00:24:59.900
Ranma missed his chance!

00:25:00.010 --> 00:25:00.770
Oh, dear.

00:25:07.980 --> 00:25:13.080
And so I was released
from the doll of revenge.

00:25:14.190 --> 00:25:18.790
But I still have no idea
why it was so angry.

00:25:20.560 --> 00:25:23.790
Here you go.
Back just like I found you.

00:25:24.700 --> 00:25:27.290
SO IT'S ALL YOUR FAULT!!

00:25:28.170 --> 00:25:31.400
So Akane was possessed by that doll.

00:25:32.010 --> 00:25:34.480
I knew she act weirdly.

00:25:34.580 --> 00:25:37.550
Who'd expect Akane to attack Ranma?

00:25:37.650 --> 00:25:40.310
Quite an experience.

00:25:40.920 --> 00:25:44.650
Akane, you've had
enough vengeance already.

00:25:48.660 --> 00:25:50.390
I liked you better before.

00:25:50.490 --> 00:25:52.820
What?

00:25:52.930 --> 00:25:57.160
You were cuter... nicer... sexier...

00:25:57.270 --> 00:25:58.960
You jerk!

00:25:59.070 --> 00:26:01.540
Quit saying that!
